{
    "_note": [
        "Reference sample ONLY - no code reads this file. It documents the shape of the JSON",
        "returned by dependency.GetDependencyInfo() (the 'magicToken' passed into UserData and",
        "into ParallelCluster/ECS/EKS/Batch config builders).",
        "Keys are '<TYPE>:<id>' where <TYPE> is the forge key upper-cased by",
        "core/manager/forgemanager.go:processForge (e.g. forge 'lustre' -> 'LUSTRE:fsx').",
        "For an EC2 forge with instanceCount > 1 the numeric suffix is trimmed, so 'EC2:master'",
        "covers master.1, master.2, ...",
        "Only forges that implement GetProperties() can be used as a dependsOn target:",
        "DS, EC2, ECS, EFS, EKS, LUSTRE, RDS (and VPC, which is however never stored in",
        "dependency.GlobalManager because ForgeManager.CreateVPC bypasses processForge).",
        "BATCH, PARALLELCLUSTER and HYPERPOD do not implement GetProperties() and therefore",
        "resolve to 'resource not found'.",
        "Property values below are placeholders; at synth time most of them are CDK tokens.",
        "The property names are authoritative and mirror the forges/aws/*/*.go code."
    ],
